WEBVTT

00:27:30.276 --> 00:27:32.570
Where you get people convinced

00:27:32.594 --> 00:27:37.268
that you stand for higher
principles and moral ideals,

00:27:37.292 --> 00:27:40.055
and then the moment
that you deviate from those,

00:27:40.079 --> 00:27:41.379
there's a giant gap

00:27:41.403 --> 00:27:43.807
and people are very quick to point out

00:27:43.831 --> 00:27:46.351
that you are not practicing
what you preach.

00:27:47.207 --> 00:27:49.703
I'm curious to hear
your perspective on that

00:27:49.727 --> 00:27:55.762
and do you feel like some
of what happened at WeWork was hypocrisy

00:27:55.786 --> 00:28:01.820
because the values and aspirations
were preached in such an aspirational way?